  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-led micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs) Empowerment through AI (WE-AI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To generate a five-country snapshot of AI readiness, risks, and adoption 
barriers for women-led MSMEs; Identify ecosystem, skills, safety, and policy gaps relevant to responsible AI adoption; Produce and pilot test a refined AI learning prototype to provide proof-of-concept of potential interventions to support AI readiness of women-led MSMEs; Facilitate a regional policy roundtable to link findings to policy processes through participation of ASEAN and; Provide actionable inputs to FCDO&#x2019;s wider UK&#x2013;ASEAN digital and AI agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
